          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:antarctica#e-af70c03fef66c76a",
          "text": "And it was in Chile she discovered she could get last-minute cheap deals on ships going to Antarctica from the islands off Tierra del Fuego, the southernmost tip of the South American mainland.",
          "source": {
